Package: phoenix-control-center
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Phoenix OS Project <build@phoenix-os.io>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, smartmontools, nvme-cli, lm-sensors, policykit-1, polkit-kde-agent-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Phoenix OS Control Center
 Unified repair, diagnostics, and system control application.
 The primary tool for Phoenix OS repair and recovery workflows.
 Features:
  - Disk health: S.M.A.R.T. data, NVMe health, temperature
  - System diagnostics: CPU, memory, thermal, storage
  - Network status and configuration
  - Service management (systemd unit control)
  - Phoenix Key integration
  - Repair workflow launcher
